use firn/tags

bitwarden-cli is a Module
bitwarden-cli is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.bitwarden-cli.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.bitwarden-cli]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."bitwarden-cli"."enable": enable "bw — Bitwarden vault CLI"
